---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Boreal Plating | Integrated industrial solutions" description="Surface treatment, machining, injection molding and component manufacturing with precision, control and traceability." lang="en" path="/en/">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <img src="/images/peca-industrial.webp" alt="Metal-finished industrial component produced by Boreal" width="1800" height="1100" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow light">ENGINEERING · PROCESS · FINISHING</p>
      <h1>Integrated solutions for demanding industrial processes.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Boreal brings surface treatment, machining, injection molding and component manufacturing together in an operation built around precision and control.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/en/what-we-do/">Explore our capabilities <span>↗</span></a><a class="button button-outline" href="/en/contact/">Contact us <span>↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-index">SINCE 1988</div>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container intro-grid reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">BOREAL PLATING</p><h2>Industrial heritage, precision and continuous evolution.</h2></div><div class="intro-copy"><p>Since 1988, Boreal has built a trajectory grounded in technical knowledge, process control and attention to detail. From Joinville, the company expanded its structure and integrated production stages to serve demanding industrial applications.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/about/">Discover our history <span>→</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-ice"><div class="container"><div class="heading-row reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">INDUSTRIAL CAPABILITY</p><h2>Connected processes, from development to finishing.</h2></div><p>A structure designed to integrate stages and keep technical requirements under control.</p></div><div class="feature-grid">
    <article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="feature-number">01</span><h3>Surface treatment</h3><p>Chemical and electrolytic processes with controlled parameters, thickness and finish.</p></article><article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="feature-number">02</span><h3>Machining</h3><p>Dimensionally controlled manufacturing with precision, repeatability and traceability.</p></article><article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="feature-number">03</span><h3>Injection molding</h3><p>Manufacturing of plastic parts and integration with industrial assemblies.</p></article><article class="feature-card reveal"><span class="feature-number">04</span><h3>Manufacturing and finishing</h3><p>Metal components, assembly, mechanical finishing, painting and coatings.</p></article></div><div style="margin-top:34px"><a class="text-link" href="/en/what-we-do/">Explore our solutions <span>→</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div class="media-frame reveal"><img src="/images/processo-plating.webp" alt="Metal parts during a finishing process at Boreal" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT</p><h2>Knowledge applied to better processes.</h2><p class="lead">Surface engineering, testing, material characterization and continuous development support solutions aligned with each project's requirements.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/r-and-d/">Explore our R&D <span>→</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-tight section-dark"><div class="container editorial-cards"><a class="editorial-card reveal" href="/en/esg/"><img src="/images/fachada-boreal.webp" alt="Boreal Plating industrial site in Joinville" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" /><div><p class="eyebrow light">ESG</p><h3>Responsibility integrated into operations.</h3><p>Environmental management, social commitment and governance supported by public documents.</p><span class="text-link">Explore our practices →</span></div></a><a class="editorial-card reveal" href="/en/certifications/"><img src="/images/peca-cromada.webp" alt="Chrome-finished components" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" /><div><p class="eyebrow light">CERTIFICATIONS</p><h3>Quality validated by recognized standards.</h3><p>ISO 9001:2015, AS9100:2016 and Cyber Trust Europe.</p><span class="text-link">View certifications →</span></div></a></div></section>
  <CTA lang="en" />
</BaseLayout>
